Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.77,0:00:03.73,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\c&H81ACD1&\3c&H406D47&\b1\move(132.667,354.667,132.667,170.667)}Katagiri High School
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.05,0:00:05.95,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,How'd you do on the mock exam?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.95,0:00:07.73,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Not too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:13.74,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Third-year high schoolers have fun, \Nbut we spend a lot of time studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.44,0:00:18.99,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}When we get home, we fight through \Nreviewing our lessons and old exam problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:23.00,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}In our spare time, we study vocabulary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.81,0:00:27.37,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}My singular reprieve\Nfrom the daily grind is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.42,0:00:30.76,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1340,1)\an8\fnArial\b1\fs18\3c&H036BEE&\4c&H1222C7&}The super popular {\c&H14107C&}{red}KONOHA\N{\c&HDEFF44&\3c&H626E46&\4c&H1A2624&}{blue}will be adapted into an anime!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.16,0:00:32.18,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}reading manga!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.18,0:00:34.13,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's the highlight of my week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:38.25,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's a double agent?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.25,0:00:41.19,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait, how?! I never saw that coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.19,0:00:43.77,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}I thought he was just going \Nthrough his daily routine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.77,0:00:46.27,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,1)\an4\fnArial\fs14\shad0\pos(316.666,186.667)\frz11.74\c&H202027&\3c&HC4D2DE&\b1}A friendship betrayed...\NWhat will happen to Konoha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.77,0:00:46.27,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,1)\fnTimes New Roman\fs12\shad0\c&H29333C&\3c&HC5D4DD&\b1\frz9.928\pos(318,304.667)}To be continued next week
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.81,0:00:46.26,Main - Top,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}No kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:51.61,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Next week can't come soon enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.45,0:02:31.63,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,You're sure in high spirits, Sakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.28,0:02:34.04,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,I'm heading home!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.85,0:02:39.66,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}The next {\i0}Konoha{\i1}! The next {\i0}Konoha{\i1}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.66,0:02:43.58,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}The next {\i0}Konoha{\i1}! The next {\i0}Konoha{\i1}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.58,0:02:47.77,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}The next {\i0}Konoha{\i1}! The next {\i0}Konoha{\i1}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.77,0:02:48.77,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,440)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\shad0\bord3\fax.3\fs28\c&H987B65&\3c&H836731&\pos(219.334,194.667)}Empty
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.45,0:02:53.95,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.95,0:02:56.26,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Did you get the new {\i1}{\i1}Weekly Shinobi{\i0}{\i0} today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.26,0:02:57.78,Main,Employee,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.78,0:03:00.49,Main,Employee,0,0,0,,We just sold out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.92,0:03:05.56,Main,Employee,0,0,0,,Should we put one on backorder?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.56,0:03:07.54,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.39,0:03:11.72,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}The convenience stores always \Nsell out on release day,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.72,0:03:13.57,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}so I came straight to the book store.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.13,0:03:16.05,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,The next {\i1}Konoha{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:20.53,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.88,0:03:25.30,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(2268,1)\an8\fnComic Sans MS\fs48\shad0\bord4\c&H1F2121&\3c&HE6F1E9&}AAAAAGH
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.53,0:03:24.77,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}After thinking about {\i0}Konoha{\i1} all day, \Nthe shock might just kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.77,0:03:25.30,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.08,0:03:27.14,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Kono-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.12,0:03:30.70,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Y-Yanagi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.70,0:03:31.81,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.81,0:03:33.64,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}He saw me being weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.06,0:03:36.47,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Are you looking for the new {\i1}Weekly Shinobi{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.47,0:03:38.75,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,H-How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.07,0:03:43.49,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,You were talking about "the next {\i1}Konoha{\i0}."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.81,0:03:47.28,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}How embarrassing...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.28,0:03:50.40,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Um, you can have this if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.57,0:03:54.64,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,I haven't opened it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.16,0:03:57.08,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:04:00.71,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.22,0:04:05.01,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,I just came in to kill time \Nuntil my bus comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.01,0:04:08.43,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,It was the last copy,\Nso I felt compelled to buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.97,0:04:13.26,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,The station I'm going to has \Nlots of books, so I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.51,0:04:17.15,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,My bus will be here soon, so I've gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.15,0:04:18.92,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.36,0:04:22.04,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,I'll pay you back tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:24.29,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Yanagi-kun, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.29,0:04:25.94,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.80,0:04:28.12,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,just like Kaoru-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.78,0:04:32.62,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1)\pos(310,36)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\shad0\blur4\c&H2D2F6D&\3c&H7D7DE8&}SPARKLE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.78,0:04:32.62,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs16\shad0\c&H362F5A&\3c&HEEF3F2&\pos(205.333,162)\frz16.46\b1}Mysterious \Nbut helpful
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.78,0:04:32.62,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs16\shad0\c&H362F5A&\3c&HEEF3F2&\b1\frz347.8\pos(429.333,130)}Kind to friends\Nand foes alike
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.78,0:04:32.62,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1)\pos(320.667,268.667)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\c&H383F56&\3c&HEEF3F2&\pos(205.333,162)\b1}{bottom}Kaoru-san
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.78,0:04:32.62,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs10\shad0\c&H383F56&\3c&HEEF3F2&\pos(320,313.333)}A character from {\b1\i1}Skull Ninja Konoha{\b0\i0}. Nin-nin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.41,0:04:35.88,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Er, thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:37.13,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's weirded out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.13,0:04:40.67,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}I compared him to one of \Nthe characters and he froze!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.67,0:04:42.88,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why did I have to go and say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.68,0:04:50.64,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(130,1)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\c&H31353D&\3c&HEEF3F2&\b1\pos(106,58.667)\frz19.09}A mysterious woman
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.96,0:04:50.64,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kaoru-san's a female character!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.07,0:04:50.64,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(130,1)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\fs14\c&H31353D&\3c&HEEF3F2&\b1\pos(278,49.334)\frz349.4}Ya need some help?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.13,0:04:53.35,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is she saying I'm effeminate?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:55.19,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'd better be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.52,0:04:59.77,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,930)\fnComic Sans MS\bord3\shad0\c&H3B2D2D&\3c&HD4DDD5&\b1\pos(464,73.333)}SHOCK
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.86,0:04:59.68,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}I weirded him out.\NHe's definitely weirded out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.68,0:05:00.32,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.91,0:05:10.92,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}I guess Yanagi-kun reads manga, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.67,0:05:16.54,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Kono-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.54,0:05:19.40,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Oh, Yanagi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.83,0:05:21.41,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Are you going to the bookstore?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.41,0:05:22.09,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.44,0:05:24.72,Main,_Both,0,0,0,,It's {\i1}Weekly Shinobi{\i0} release day!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.77,0:05:31.39,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,I just can't put down {\i1}Konoha{\i0} lately!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.39,0:05:32.62,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,I hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.98,0:05:35.87,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,I usually wait for the full-book publication,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.87,0:05:39.18,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,but once I start reading the weekly \Nmagazines, I can't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.18,0:05:40.45,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.45,0:05:42.34,Main,Female Student A,0,0,0,,They sure don't look like a couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.94,0:05:46.01,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}I haven't heard that in a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.07,0:05:45.99,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,940)\an5\fnComic Sans MS\fs48\shad0\bord0\c&H291711&\3c&H703B56&\pos(323.333,163.333)}SNAP
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.01,0:05:49.20,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've been hanging around with \NHori's group so long I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.13,0:05:51.85,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sh-Should I be about this far?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.45,0:05:53.77,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Did I upset you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.77,0:05:55.18,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,No, it's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.18,0:05:56.71,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,It's, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.71,0:06:02.03,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,If I walk next to you, it'll, um... \Nmake the other girls jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.12,0:06:06.24,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:08.89,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Because you're such a cool guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.89,0:06:11.60,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.60,0:06:14.78,Flashback,Remi,0,0,0,,Sakura, I got a paper cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.78,0:06:16.88,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,Think of something fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.88,0:06:18.69,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,We get to go home early today!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.69,0:06:20.51,Flashback,Remi,0,0,0,,Oh? Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.51,0:06:21.75,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.75,0:06:24.24,Flashback,Sakura,0,0,0,,It was just a bug. Nothing to cry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.24,0:06:25.54,Flashback,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I'm not crying...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.54,0:06:28.17,Flashback,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Is it really gone? For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.17,0:06:29.90,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,You're far cooler!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.90,0:06:31.40,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,What? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.76,0:06:33.33,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:36.06,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,You're obviously much cooler than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.06,0:06:39.26,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,No, I think I'd want you \Nthere if I got hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.26,0:06:40.66,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.76,0:06:44.18,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yanagi-kun's a good guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.18,0:06:45.30,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}but he can be a bit odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.64,0:06:47.13,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Paper cut...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.13,0:06:49.90,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Moreover, if I had to choose...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.90,0:06:53.14,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'd prefer being c-c-cute over cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.05,0:06:56.69,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,By the way, I haven't seen you \Nwear your glasses lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.69,0:07:00.14,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Oh, they don't really look good on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.14,0:07:02.06,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Besides, I have contacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.02,0:07:06.11,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's no way anything \Ndoesn't look good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.11,0:07:08.65,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Really, I just want a new design.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.99,0:07:10.96,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll go check out frames later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.96,0:07:14.91,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yanagi-kun's face is so delicate that\Nit makes mine stand out even more!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.43,0:07:17.09,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Want to come with, Kono-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.09,0:07:18.71,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Huh? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.71,0:07:19.74,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,To check out frames.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.74,0:07:20.76,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Frames?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.76,0:07:22.91,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,C-Can I really tag along?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.91,0:07:24.68,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,If you're busy, don't sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.68,0:07:25.99,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,I-I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.67,0:07:28.47,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}What a casual invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.47,0:07:31.68,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who could turn Yanagi-kun down?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.74,0:07:37.07,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,I just thought of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.76,0:07:41.74,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,"Yanagi" and "Sakura" are both kinds of trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.74,0:07:44.19,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Er, not that it means anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.94,0:07:52.97,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,No more!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.11,0:07:57.87,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(980,1)\an5\b1\fs36\shad0\bord3\fnComic Sans MS\c&H3A3B37&\3c&HFDF7F1&}RUUUUUUUUUUN
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.97,0:07:55.34,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Huh? Kono-san, why are you running?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.34,0:07:56.95,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Are you worried they'll be sold out?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.95,0:07:57.87,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\an9\shad0\fs18\c&H1D1F1E&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(509.485,48.786)}Running seemed\Nthe best option
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.70,0:08:00.08,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,360)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\c&H333F4D&\3c&HEEF3F2&\b1\fs16\pos(336.667,35.334)}That's a good color.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.56,0:08:01.38,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everything looks good on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.12,0:08:01.33,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,360)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\c&H333F4D&\3c&HEEF3F2&\b1\fs16\pos(188.667,40.001)}You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:02.66,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,360)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\c&H333F4D&\3c&HEEF3F2&\b1\fs16\pos(131.334,91.334)}Maybe I'll \Nbuy these.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.71,0:08:03.71,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fs48\shad0\bord0\c&H0FB9BB&\move(534,112,420,112)}I'm Her
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.71,0:08:06.71,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,A guy and a girl swap bodies!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.71,0:08:04.71,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fs48\shad0\c&H177941&\3c&H34BDEB&\move(390,246,390,155.333)}She's Me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.17,0:08:08.82,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,What book is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:11.17,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Oh, I remember this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.17,0:08:12.29,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,It's really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.29,0:08:13.50,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.29,0:08:15.09,Main - Top,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Posture, Yoshikawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.50,0:08:15.09,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,That {\i1}I'm Her{\i0} thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.09,0:08:17.04,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,They made a TV drama out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.04,0:08:19.13,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Really? I didn't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.13,0:08:22.28,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}If Hori and Miyamura swapped bodies...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.28,0:08:27.95,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean, Toru?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.95,0:08:29.36,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Now, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.61,0:08:30.44,Main - Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.44,0:08:31.34,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.34,0:08:32.61,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.61,0:08:35.07,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Someone left their pencil case \Nin the student council room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.07,0:08:37.13,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Oh, maybe it's Shu's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.74,0:08:36.57,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,140)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\c&H1D2221&\3c&HEEF3F2&\bord3\b1\fs30\pos(200.667,34.667)}Shu...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.13,0:08:38.61,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Did anyone forget a pencil case?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.26,0:08:43.74,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,There you go again, Ishikawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.74,0:08:46.55,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Man, you're noisy. Pipe down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.31,0:08:49.00,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,The heck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.00,0:08:51.28,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Oh, here you are, Sengoku-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.83,0:08:55.26,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,That case belongs to a second-year \Non next year's student council.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.26,0:08:57.71,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,I'm glad we found the owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.59,0:09:01.16,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Let's go to a cake buffet later!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.16,0:09:04.05,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,We've got cram school first. Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.71,0:09:07.29,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,What's with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.78,0:09:10.23,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,She keeps humming to herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.23,0:09:11.65,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Let's just leave her be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.02,0:09:16.48,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,It's 'cause Hori was him, \Nand then Remi-chan and Kono-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.17,0:09:18.41,Main - Top,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Knock it off. It's getting old.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.33,0:09:22.64,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I have cooking class next!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.64,0:09:24.25,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Nice. Knock 'em dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.79,0:09:25.89,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.89,0:09:27.09,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.77,0:09:32.30,Main - Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,But if {\i0}we{\i1} traded places, what would \NI do in the restroom or the bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:33.65,Main - Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,Guys and girls can't go together...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.65,0:09:35.05,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,What's going on, Yoshikawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.05,0:09:36.30,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You can come back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.89,0:09:38.50,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,What about the restroom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.50,0:09:40.43,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,The restroom?! What about it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.85,0:09:43.21,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,If you need to use it, just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.21,0:09:44.72,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,It's not good to hold it too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.18,0:09:47.95,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,It's way more complicated than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.95,0:09:49.33,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:50.19,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(230,1)\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs20\c&H1D1F1E&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(108.152,176.119)}Confusion
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.19,0:09:52.19,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\c&H6D6875&\3c&HDBDADD&\pos(318,130.666)}Library
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.19,0:09:55.19,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I'm sure it would feel weird \Nfor you to call me by my first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:09:58.48,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Kyoko-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:10:01.95,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fad(1,270)\shad0\c&H333F4D&\3c&HEEF3F2&\b1\fs16\frz21.11\move(94.667,155,163.334,155)}Shudder
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.04,0:10:00.57,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Kyoko-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.95,0:10:04.30,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,This is no time for goofing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.30,0:10:05.68,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I'll go buy some writing paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.68,0:10:07.08,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.54,0:10:09.49,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Hori, get some pencil lead, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.49,0:10:10.90,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.08,0:10:13.34,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\c&H6D6875&\3c&HDBDADD&\pos(318,130.666)}Library
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.59,0:10:27.60,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I forgot to ask for more red pens!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.05,0:10:40.35,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,I didn't think anyone else was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.35,0:10:42.46,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Oh, I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.46,0:10:43.49,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.49,0:10:44.53,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.87,0:10:46.62,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,I got here just as Hori-san was leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.71,0:10:50.37,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,This book is cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.16,0:10:52.06,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.09,0:10:54.13,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:02.16,Main,Yanagi,0,0,0,,Your hand is just too warm, Yoshikawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.80,0:11:08.86,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}The backs of our hands touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.77,0:11:11.48,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,440)\fnComic Sans MS\fs18\shad0\bord0\c&H7C7883&\move(532,54,552,54)}Thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.97,0:11:13.07,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yanagi-kun's hand felt so cold...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.77,0:11:12.48,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,440)\fnComic Sans MS\fs18\shad0\bord0\c&H7C7883&\move(319.333,58.667,303.333,58.667)}No prob
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.78,0:11:20.28,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Hey, did you finish your report?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:21.65,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,My hand's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.65,0:11:22.53,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.53,0:11:25.03,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,My hand's really cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.03,0:11:26.79,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.29,0:11:28.93,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Feels pretty warm to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.29,0:11:30.54,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(310,1)\an5\fnImpact\fs30\pos(313.333,185.333)\c&H8DF3F4&\3c&H244364&\4c&HEEF0FB&}SQUEEZE\NSQUEEZE
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.93,0:11:30.54,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Mine's way colder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.54,0:11:33.29,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Y-You don't need to grab \Nand touch it that much!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.56,0:11:35.13,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.38,0:11:35.92,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,440)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\c&H333F4D&\3c&HEEF3F2&\b1\bord3\pos(213.334,42.001)}PRESS
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.38,0:11:38.38,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You're such a pain! \NWhat'd you expect me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.38,0:11:42.13,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Y-Y-Yanagi-kun doesn't touch me like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.84,0:11:44.93,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,So you don't want me doing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.93,0:11:46.76,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,That's not what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.01,0:11:48.24,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,What a pain in the neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.24,0:11:50.77,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I don't get you, Yoshikawa. \NYou're such a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.02,0:11:52.23,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,440)\fnComic Sans MS\c&HCB7120&\3c&H292023&\b1\bord3\an8\fs48\4c&HF5F4EF&\i1}SNAP
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.02,0:11:53.12,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Yoshikawa, you are seriously a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.77,0:11:57.15,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,1)\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs20\c&H1D1F1E&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(569.486,162.119)}More or less \Nhonest
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.12,0:11:54.28,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I'm not messing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.28,0:11:57.16,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,I-I thought you {\i1}were{\i0} messing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.77,0:11:59.08,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Have you warmed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.08,0:12:01.73,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Yeah, but now I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.73,0:12:03.42,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,It's from writing that report.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.88,0:12:05.33,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Time to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.06,0:12:08.92,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Wanna hold hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.92,0:12:10.16,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.41,0:12:12.50,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I don't get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.98,0:12:15.42,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Toru's hands are cold, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:19.04,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}But when he's with me, they warm up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.25,0:12:24.26,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Miyamura, are you headed out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.26,0:12:27.53,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Yeah, I need to stop by the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.01,0:12:28.97,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.97,0:12:29.88,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.99,0:12:35.02,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Man, it's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.78,0:12:45.93,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Sawada?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.79,0:13:00.07,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.44,0:13:04.55,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Sawada.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.09,0:13:07.82,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Don't you have any friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.37,0:13:09.55,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.02,0:13:11.69,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,You're asking {\i1}me{\i0} why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.06,0:13:15.05,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Well, at least tell me \Nif you're being bullied.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.43,0:13:21.56,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Okay, you don't need to tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.56,0:13:25.07,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,but it looks like those kids on the third \Nfloor threw your scarf out the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.68,0:13:28.54,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Walk over to me if I'm right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:41.09,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.80,0:13:57.22,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Hey, what was that? Did you do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.22,0:13:58.22,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.25,0:14:01.44,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:03.86,Main,Female Student A,0,0,0,,Did he just mouth "Die, uggos" at us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.86,0:14:06.86,Main,Female Student B,0,0,0,,Now I'm pissed! Who does he think he is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.79,0:14:11.87,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,So... you're being bullied, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.61,0:14:18.10,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I just had a different opinion \Nthan everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.10,0:14:21.63,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Then they suddenly started ignoring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.44,0:14:24.04,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,That's how things are sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.71,0:14:28.63,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,You don't know how it feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.95,0:14:31.51,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,You've got tons of friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.03,0:14:39.04,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,It's not like I went around begging \Neach of them to be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.34,0:14:43.17,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Things are bound to get better for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:47.64,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,You can just ignore those idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.64,0:14:48.59,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.59,0:14:52.07,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,When they beg you to be friends with them,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.07,0:14:53.78,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,you'll have won.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.78,0:14:56.54,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Wh-What does winning get me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.86,0:14:58.51,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I figured you wanted to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.51,0:14:59.86,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.05,0:15:03.79,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:06.41,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I accidentally stepped on your scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.88,0:15:10.05,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Hey, ow! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:15.31,Main,Female Student C,0,0,0,,Sawada-san sure gets along \Nwith the third-years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.31,0:15:18.50,Main,Female Student D,0,0,0,,She must like talking to them \Nmore than her classmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:21.83,Main,Female Student C,0,0,0,,I know what you mean. Every time—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.18,0:15:23.50,Main,Female Student D,0,0,0,,She's looking at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.50,0:15:24.60,Main,Female Student C,0,0,0,,Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.28,0:15:27.76,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.12,0:15:35.11,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not that I don't want \Nto get along with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.11,0:15:37.97,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,{\i1}I just don't know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.58,0:15:43.45,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,{\i1}It makes being in class uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.23,0:15:45.91,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,The wind's so strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.91,0:15:47.36,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Oh, Sawada-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.46,0:15:49.98,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,It's so cold...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.98,0:15:53.72,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Sawada-san, come inside. It's cold out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.84,0:15:57.85,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,What were you doing out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.47,0:16:00.35,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Am I weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.48,0:16:04.14,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Yeah, pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:07.98,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,But being a little weird is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.84,0:16:12.23,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.23,0:16:13.87,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.87,0:16:15.99,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,And if {\i1}you're{\i0} weird, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.99,0:16:18.24,Main - Top,Yuki,0,0,0,,What about Remi-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.99,0:16:18.24,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,What about Yuki-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.97,0:16:24.57,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Sawada-san, you can have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.57,0:16:26.95,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,It's stag beetle candy.\NIt tastes like stag beetles!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.95,0:16:29.25,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,You don't have to take it, Sawada-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.81,0:16:31.51,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I-I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.51,0:16:33.82,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,See how popular stag beetles are?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.82,0:16:35.51,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Is popularity really the issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.51,0:16:37.39,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,D-Do I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.29,0:16:42.27,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,get along with third-years too well?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.59,0:16:45.16,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Huh? What's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.69,0:16:50.15,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I don't really have any friends \Nin my own grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.15,0:16:51.45,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.90,0:16:54.05,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Ah, that's rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.05,0:16:56.27,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,There's always a lot of group work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.27,0:16:58.03,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,And girls pick their groups quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.03,0:16:59.74,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.74,0:17:01.66,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,That's it. That's exactly it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.66,0:17:06.98,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Um, Sawada-san, are you \Nhaving trouble with your class?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.98,0:17:08.04,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:10.99,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Th-Things are tough, but I'm still okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.99,0:17:12.14,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.14,0:17:13.17,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.65,0:17:16.68,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,If you aren't enjoying yourself, \Nyou can come tell us about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.17,0:17:22.18,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,We're not in your class, so hearing \Nyou out is about all we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.58,0:17:24.20,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Come by anytime!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.20,0:17:25.69,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.81,0:17:29.04,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,How about a drone beetle chocolate next?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.04,0:17:30.31,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,It tastes like drone beetles!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.31,0:17:30.79,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.79,0:17:33.25,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,You don't have to take it, Sawada-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.89,0:17:39.15,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm not really comfortable in my \Nclass, but I still like school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.70,0:17:42.45,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fnArial\an8\fs20\c&H24262B&\3c&HE3E7E7&\4c&HE3E7E7&}{top}ART CLUB\N{\fs16\u1}Beginners welcome!{\u0}\N{\fs14}Watercolors, oil paints, sketches...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.51,0:17:42.45,Main,Art Club A,0,0,0,,Where should we put this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.45,0:17:45.83,Main,Art Club B,0,0,0,,If only we'd reserved some \Nspace on the bulletin board...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.83,0:17:46.71,Main,Art Club A,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.03,0:17:48.33,Main,Female Student G,0,0,0,,Shimoda!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.33,0:17:51.09,Main,Female Student G,0,0,0,,Do you know any bulletin \Nboards that aren't full?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.09,0:17:53.52,Main,Shimoda,0,0,0,,Sure. What about the one \Nat the main entrance?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.52,0:17:55.59,Main,Female Student G,0,0,0,,The third-years use that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.59,0:17:56.66,Main,Female Student G,0,0,0,,They'll get mad at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.66,0:17:57.40,Main,Shimoda,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.40,0:18:00.60,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,{\i1}Recruiting for clubs seems hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.60,0:18:04.06,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fnArial\an8\shad0\bord0\fs20\c&H080B0F&\3c&HE3E7E7&\4c&HE3E7E7&\pos(31.333,75.333)}{top}ART CLUB\N{\fs16\u1}Beginners welcome!{\u0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.10,0:18:08.85,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.19,0:18:10.36,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,And afterward...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.16,0:18:12.35,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Sawada-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.70,0:18:16.70,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,You were trying to fix that poster?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.27,0:18:20.17,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,They're supposed to be\Ncompletely within the frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.17,0:18:22.45,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Sengoku-kun, there's a pushpin on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.45,0:18:26.01,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Yeah, the frame's pretty hard,\Nso it wouldn't go in deep enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.01,0:18:27.62,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,A-Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.19,0:18:30.74,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,That poster is my friends'—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.74,0:18:32.32,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,My classmates'—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.32,0:18:35.13,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Um, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.71,0:18:38.42,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,It's for a club some people in my class are in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.42,0:18:41.21,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,They said they're having trouble recruiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.21,0:18:47.02,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I think they made it big so \Nit would stand out, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.58,0:18:50.28,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Maybe it could stay up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.93,0:18:54.04,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I'm taking it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.00,0:18:56.60,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,This will be hard without a chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.60,0:18:59.65,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Should I get one from the home ec room?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.28,0:19:01.90,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's unlocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.53,0:19:04.93,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I'll take it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.93,0:19:06.05,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Stand aside, Sengoku!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.05,0:19:08.41,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Hey, you know you can't reach it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.59,0:19:11.79,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.79,0:19:13.30,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Stop moving! You're scaring me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.79,0:19:14.67,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs20\c&H1D1F1E&\3c&HE9F0EE&\an5\pos(272.667,166)}Passerby Y
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.78,0:19:15.31,Main - Top,Yuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}They look like a family on their day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.30,0:19:15.31,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.31,0:19:17.05,Main - Top,Yuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stay strong, Sengoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.31,0:19:17.05,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Pass me the pushpin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.39,0:19:18.52,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I got it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.52,0:19:19.62,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,You can put me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.62,0:19:20.80,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.54,0:19:23.37,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Next stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.37,0:19:25.56,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,What? Hey, wait. Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.56,0:19:28.56,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Put me down! I got the poster off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.96,0:19:29.79,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,You're heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.79,0:19:31.56,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Then hurry up and put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.95,0:19:33.40,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Here we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.32,0:19:40.85,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,{\i1}The main entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.85,0:19:43.20,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Hand me the poster. I'll put it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.20,0:19:44.14,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.14,0:19:48.95,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,No matter how big it is, no one's \Ngoing to see it in that secluded spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.95,0:19:51.21,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Remi, put that one over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.21,0:19:51.70,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.70,0:19:55.06,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,And then, look, there's enough space here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.86,0:20:01.97,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I thought that second-years \Ncouldn't use this bulletin board.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.97,0:20:03.18,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.18,0:20:06.59,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Huh? Because the third-years \Nare always using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.59,0:20:08.72,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,This is a shared space.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.72,0:20:11.28,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I thought we'd get in trouble if we used it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.28,0:20:12.35,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.35,0:20:17.36,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Then I guess we'll need a poster that says \Nany grade can use this bulletin board.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.84,0:20:19.61,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,All done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.61,0:20:22.11,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fnArial\an8\fs20\c&H24262B&\3c&HE3E7E7&\4c&HE3E7E7&}{top}ART CLUB\N{\fs16\u1}Beginners welcome!{\u0}\N{\fs14}Watercolors, oil paints, sketches. and sculpting\NCome check it out anytime!\NSee the art room for details
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.63,0:20:28.12,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Now every student who comes \Nthrough the door will see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.12,0:20:30.87,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,I hope some people come check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.94,0:20:34.50,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Remiremi-senpai, thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.87,0:20:36.00,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Sengoku!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.98,0:20:40.26,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.55,0:20:42.55,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.26,0:20:45.21,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Say, Sawada-san, would you like candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.21,0:20:46.51,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,Not right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.51,0:20:48.49,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,How about some stag beetle chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.21,0:20:56.44,Main,Art Club B,0,0,0,,Sawada-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.52,0:21:03.57,Main,Art Club A,0,0,0,,I heard you rehung our \Nrecruitment poster. Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.57,0:21:07.14,Main,Art Club B,0,0,0,,Shimoda said he saw you do it \Ntwo days ago after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.14,0:21:08.41,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,{\i1}He saw me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.71,0:21:15.06,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I-It's not like that. It was put up \Nwhere it shouldn't have been,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.06,0:21:17.82,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,so I moved it to a suitable place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.82,0:21:19.54,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,And it wasn't really me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.99,0:21:22.55,Main,Art Club B,0,0,0,,A first-year came by to check out the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.91,0:21:26.75,Main,Art Club B,0,0,0,,That was all, sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.75,0:21:30.20,Main,Art Club A,0,0,0,,But we've never had a first-year come before!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.20,0:21:33.64,Main,Art Club B,0,0,0,,When I heard they saw the poster,\N I was really surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.06,0:21:37.56,Main,Art Club B,0,0,0,,But it made me really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.96,0:21:39.93,Main,Art Club B,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sawada-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.51,0:21:42.32,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.08,0:21:46.59,Main,Sawada,0,0,0,,I hope you get someone to sign up next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.24,0:21:48.18,Main,_Both,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.22,0:21:51.70,Main,Art Club A,0,0,0,,Oh, and I wanted to ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.58,0:21:57.18,Main,Art Club A,0,0,0,,Is it true you used the council \Npresident to get around?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.90,0:22:00.78,Main - Top,Sawada,0,0,0,,N-No! Well, actually, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.96,0:22:10.01,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1270,530)\fnArial\b1\bord0\fs16\shad1\c&HDC8858&\3c&H514946&\4c&H3C342D&\pos(132.545,333.091)}Friends
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.78,0:22:04.92,Main - Top,Art Club B,0,0,0,,So the class president's arms \Nand legs may as well be your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.92,0:22:07.62,Main - Top,Art Club A,0,0,0,,And you're related to that \Nthird-year with piercings?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.62,0:22:10.01,Main - Top,Sawada,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.22,0:22:16.77,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fs20\shad0\pos(326.667,268)\c&H0D141C&\3c&HD6F8F9&}Konoha!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.03,0:22:29.03,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnImpact\i1\c&HC29A39&\shad0\3c&HD3D9D6&}Skull Ninja\N{\i0\fs36\c&H0600A8&}Konoha
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.01,0:22:55.45,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,400)\shad0\bord0\an4\fnImpact\c&HFEFAFA&}Clang
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.24,0:22:55.60,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,400)\shad0\bord2\an9\fnArial\b1\c&HFEFAFA&\3c&H080C09&\pos(604,39.333)}Gyan
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.60,0:22:56.77,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\bord1\i1\pos(553.333,85.333)\3c&HE5F1F0&\c&H06090B&}Punished
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.76,0:23:40.02,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an4\fnArial\fs12\shad0\c&H232A3D&\3c&HC4D0E1&\frz36.46\pos(345.599,182.534)}Konoha dances\N yet again tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.76,0:23:40.02,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs10\shad0\c&H29333C&\3c&HC4D0E1&\b1\frz30.15\pos(494,275.334)}To be continued next week
